{start_of_verse: Verse 5}
[B]Goin' where the [D]wind don't blow so [A]strange,
[B]Maybe off on some [D]high cold mountain [A]chain
[D]Lost one round but the [A]prize wasn't [G]anything,
A [D]knife in the [Dm]back and [A]more of the [B]same
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 6}
Same old, rat in a drain ditch, caught on a limb,
You know better but I know him
Like I told you, what I said,
